(slower-b747-sv01-climb-cruise-3dof)
*title B747 sixty-second powered climb and level-off reduction
*atmos standard
*earth spherical gm=3.986004418e14 omega=0
*units/fmt alt m f.3
*units/fmt vel m/sec f.3
*units/fmt mass kg f.3
*units/fmt long deg f.3
*units/fmt lat deg f.3
*units/fmt gama deg f.3
*units/fmt psi deg f.3
*runtime status target latitude-deg=0.0 longitude-deg=0.014 altitude-m=140.0
*runtime status route mode=great-circle start-latitude-deg=0.0 start-longitude-deg=0.0 duration-s=60.0 altitude-profile=linear-target start-altitude-m=100.0 powered-speed-mps=153.0 powered-climb-rate-mps=0.7
*trajectory 1 b747 start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=100.0 long=0.0 lat=0.0 vel=153.0 gama=0.0 psi=90.0 time=0.0 mass=288756.9
  *segment 1 climb-cruise
    *integ dtprnt=0.2 dt=0.05
    *fly alpha=3.1
    *aero cx=(cx) cy=(cy) cz=(cz) sref=510.96672
    *prop thrust=(thrust) mdot=0
    *when time>60.0 stop
*end
